{
  "_comment": [
    "NOT mounted by -Settings. Claude Code reads ~/.claude/settings.json, which lives on",
    "the per-project home volume and also holds your model and theme, so the launcher",
    "cannot safely own it. Merge the hooks block below in by hand, once per project.",
    "",
    "Until you do, a hook in claude/hooks/ is mounted, executable and never invoked.",
    "Confirm it is actually gating:",
    "  echo '{\"tool_input\":{\"command\":\"git commit -m probe\"}}' | ~/.claude/hooks/<hook>.sh; echo $?",
    "Exit 2 means it blocks. Anything else means it does not, whatever the file looks like."
  ],
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "$HOME/.claude/hooks/commit-gate.sh" }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
